+ Challenging but fair at all times (I played on
). 4 difficulties to choose from, including a "One Life" mode for additional glory and suffering ;
+ Excellent gameplay ;
+ Controls are very responsive and grow more extensive as you progress through the game (via learning new skills and powers) while remaining accessible and a pleasure to use ;
+ Healthy amount of secrets that add to maintain a continuous sense of wonder and exploration ;
+ Soundtrack fits very well with every scenario and situation.
